§§ `Part 3 -- paras 5 to 7: electronic form`

-- Para 6: may only be sent in electronic form (a) to a person who has agreed (and has not revoked) or (b) to a company deemed by a provision to have agreed.
-- limb (a): a person who agreed, not revoked
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 6 the document or information may be sent or supplied by the company in electronic form` WITH `the intended recipient is a person who has agreed (generally or specifically) that the document or information may be sent or supplied in electronic form` IS TRUE, `the intended recipient has revoked that agreement` IS FALSE, `the intended recipient is a company deemed by a provision in the Companies Acts to have so agreed` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- limb (a) fails: agreed and revoked
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 6 the document or information may be sent or supplied by the company in electronic form` WITH `the intended recipient is a person who has agreed (generally or specifically) that the document or information may be sent or supplied in electronic form` IS TRUE, `the intended recipient has revoked that agreement` IS TRUE, `the intended recipient is a company deemed by a provision in the Companies Acts to have so agreed` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- limb (b): a company deemed to have agreed
