#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 7(2) the document or information in electronic form is handed over or sent as the paragraph requires` WITH `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 5 by hand to an address`, `the address is one to which hard copy may be sent or supplied under paragraph 4` IS JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
