#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 5 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in electronic form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 5 electronic form`, `the result of sch 5 para 6 the document or information may be sent or supplied by the company in electronic form` IS JUST TRUE, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 5 by electronic means`, `the result of sch 5 para 7(1) the address is one to which it may be sent or supplied by electronic means` IS NOTHING, `the result of sch 5 para 7(2) the document or information in electronic form is handed over or sent as the paragraph requires` IS NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- handed over: para 6 and para 7(2) JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 5 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in electronic form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 5 electronic form`, `the result of sch 5 para 6 the document or information may be sent or supplied by the company in electronic form` IS JUST TRUE, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 5 handed to the intended recipient`, `the result of sch 5 para 7(1) the address is one to which it may be sent or supplied by electronic means` IS NOTHING, `the result of sch 5 para 7(2) the document or information in electronic form is handed over or sent as the paragraph requires` IS JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- by post: para 6 and para 7(2) JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 5 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in electronic form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 5 electronic form`, `the result of sch 5 para 6 the document or information may be sent or supplied by the company in electronic form` IS JUST TRUE, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 5 by post`, `the result of sch 5 para 7(1) the address is one to which it may be sent or supplied by electronic means` IS NOTHING, `the result of sch 5 para 7(2) the document or information in electronic form is handed over or sent as the paragraph requires` IS JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- by post: para 7(2) not met
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 5 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in electronic form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 5 electronic form`, `the result of sch 5 para 6 the document or information may be sent or supplied by the company in electronic form` IS JUST TRUE, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 5 by post`, `the result of sch 5 para 7(1) the address is one to which it may be sent or supplied by electronic means` IS NOTHING, `the result of sch 5 para 7(2) the document or information in electronic form is handed over or sent as the paragraph requires` IS JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- by some other means: neither para 7(1) nor para 7(2)
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 5 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in electronic form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 5 electronic form`, `the result of sch 5 para 6 the document or information may be sent or supplied by the company in electronic form` IS JUST TRUE, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 5 by some other means`, `the result of sch 5 para 7(1) the address is one to which it may be sent or supplied by electronic means` IS JUST TRUE, `the result of sch 5 para 7(2) the document or information in electronic form is handed over or sent as the paragraph requires` IS JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- hard copy form: para 5 is about electronic form
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 5 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in electronic form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 5 hard copy form`, `the result of sch 5 para 6 the document or information may be sent or supplied by the company in electronic form` IS JUST TRUE, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 5 by electronic means`, `the result of sch 5 para 7(1) the address is one to which it may be sent or supplied by electronic means` IS JUST TRUE, `the result of sch 5 para 7(2) the document or information in electronic form is handed over or sent as the paragraph requires` IS NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- website: para 5 is about electronic form
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 5 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in electronic form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 5 made available on a website`, `the result of sch 5 para 6 the document or information may be sent or supplied by the company in electronic form` IS JUST TRUE, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 5 by electronic means`, `the result of sch 5 para 7(1) the address is one to which it may be sent or supplied by electronic means` IS JUST TRUE, `the result of sch 5 para 7(2) the document or information in electronic form is handed over or sent as the paragraph requires` IS NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- none of those forms: para 5 is about electronic form
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 5 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in electronic form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 5 none of those forms`, `the result of sch 5 para 6 the document or information may be sent or supplied by the company in electronic form` IS JUST TRUE, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 5 by electronic means`, `the result of sch 5 para 7(1) the address is one to which it may be sent or supplied by electronic means` IS JUST TRUE, `the result of sch 5 para 7(2) the document or information in electronic form is handed over or sent as the paragraph requires` IS NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Part 4 -- paras 8 to 14: communications by means of a website`

-- Para 10(3)(b): the period of 28 days beginning with the date of the request includes that date, so a request sent on 1 March 2026 has 28 March 2026 as its last day.
-- request on 1 March 2026: the period ends on 28 March 2026
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 10(3)(b) the last day of the period of 28 days beginning with the date on which the request was sent` (Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS (Date 28 3 2026)
-- request on 31 December 2026: day 28 is 27 January 2027
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 10(3)(b) the last day of the period of 28 days beginning with the date on which the request was sent` (Date 31 12 2026) EQUALS (Date 27 1 2027)
-- request on 1 February 2026: day 28 is 28 February 2026
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 10(3)(b) the last day of the period of 28 days beginning with the date on which the request was sent` (Date 1 2 2026) EQUALS (Date 28 2 2026)
-- Para 10(4)(b): sent less than twelve months after a previous request. Exactly twelve months is not less than twelve months.
-- previous request 1 March 2025, new request 28 February 2026: less than twelve months
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 10(4)(b) the request was sent less than twelve months after the previous request` (Date 28 2 2026) (Date 1 3 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- previous request 1 March 2025, new request 1 March 2026: exactly twelve months, not less
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 10(4)(b) the request was sent less than twelve months after the previous request` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 1 3 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- one day more than twelve months
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 10(4)(b) the request was sent less than twelve months after the previous request` (Date 2 3 2026) (Date 1 3 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- previous request on 29 February 2024: 27 February 2025 is within twelve months (the 29 February convention is a fork)
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 10(4)(b) the request was sent less than twelve months after the previous request` (Date 27 2 2025) (Date 29 2 2024) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- previous request on 29 February 2024: twelve months taken as 28 February 2025 (clamped; fork)
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 10(4)(b) the request was sent less than twelve months after the previous request` (Date 28 2 2025) (Date 29 2 2024) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- para 10(5): applies to a resolution under this paragraph
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 10(5) Chapter 3 of Part 3 applies to the resolution` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- para 10(5): limited to a resolution under this paragraph
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 10(5) Chapter 3 of Part 3 applies to the resolution` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Para 10: a member (or nominee) is taken to agree to a website if the members resolved or the articles provide, and the company asked individually and stated clearly the effect of not responding, and received no response within the 28 days, and the request was not sent less than twelve months after a previous one.
-- member; resolution; asked; clear; no response; asked on 29 March 2026, the day after the period ended
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 10 the person is taken to have agreed that the company may send or supply documents or information to him by means of a website` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a member of the company` IS TRUE, `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a person nominated by a member in accordance with the company's articles to enjoy or exercise all or any specified rights of the member in relation to the company` IS FALSE, `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a person nominated by a member under section 146 to enjoy information rights` IS FALSE, `the members of the company have resolved that the company may send or supply documents or information to members by making them available on a website` IS TRUE, `the company's articles contain provision that the company may send or supply documents or information to members by making them available on a website` IS FALSE, `the company asked the person individually to agree that it may send or supply documents or information generally, or the documents or information in question, to him by means of a website` IS TRUE, `the date on which the company's request was sent` IS (Date 1 3 2026), `the date on which the company received a response` IS NOTHING, `the date on which the question is asked` IS (Date 29 3 2026), `the request stated clearly what the effect of a failure to respond would be` IS TRUE, `the date on which a previous request was sent for the purposes of this paragraph in respect of the same or a similar class of documents or information` IS NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no response yet and the question is asked on 28 March 2026, the last day of the period: the period has not yet ended
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 10 the person is taken to have agreed that the company may send or supply documents or information to him by means of a website` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a member of the company` IS TRUE, `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a person nominated by a member in accordance with the company's articles to enjoy or exercise all or any specified rights of the member in relation to the company` IS FALSE, `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a person nominated by a member under section 146 to enjoy information rights` IS FALSE, `the members of the company have resolved that the company may send or supply documents or information to members by making them available on a website` IS TRUE, `the company's articles contain provision that the company may send or supply documents or information to members by making them available on a website` IS FALSE, `the company asked the person individually to agree that it may send or supply documents or information generally, or the documents or information in question, to him by means of a website` IS TRUE, `the date on which the company's request was sent` IS (Date 1 3 2026), `the date on which the company received a response` IS NOTHING, `the date on which the question is asked` IS (Date 28 3 2026), `the request stated clearly what the effect of a failure to respond would be` IS TRUE, `the date on which a previous request was sent for the purposes of this paragraph in respect of the same or a similar class of documents or information` IS NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- no response yet and the question is asked on 15 March 2026
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 10 the person is taken to have agreed that the company may send or supply documents or information to him by means of a website` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a member of the company` IS TRUE, `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a person nominated by a member in accordance with the company's articles to enjoy or exercise all or any specified rights of the member in relation to the company` IS FALSE, `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a person nominated by a member under section 146 to enjoy information rights` IS FALSE, `the members of the company have resolved that the company may send or supply documents or information to members by making them available on a website` IS TRUE, `the company's articles contain provision that the company may send or supply documents or information to members by making them available on a website` IS FALSE, `the company asked the person individually to agree that it may send or supply documents or information generally, or the documents or information in question, to him by means of a website` IS TRUE, `the date on which the company's request was sent` IS (Date 1 3 2026), `the date on which the company received a response` IS NOTHING, `the date on which the question is asked` IS (Date 15 3 2026), `the request stated clearly what the effect of a failure to respond would be` IS TRUE, `the date on which a previous request was sent for the purposes of this paragraph in respect of the same or a similar class of documents or information` IS NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- a response received on 10 March 2026, within the period
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 10 the person is taken to have agreed that the company may send or supply documents or information to him by means of a website` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a member of the company` IS TRUE, `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a person nominated by a member in accordance with the company's articles to enjoy or exercise all or any specified rights of the member in relation to the company` IS FALSE, `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a person nominated by a member under section 146 to enjoy information rights` IS FALSE, `the members of the company have resolved that the company may send or supply documents or information to members by making them available on a website` IS TRUE, `the company's articles contain provision that the company may send or supply documents or information to members by making them available on a website` IS FALSE, `the company asked the person individually to agree that it may send or supply documents or information generally, or the documents or information in question, to him by means of a website` IS TRUE, `the date on which the company's request was sent` IS (Date 1 3 2026), `the date on which the company received a response` IS (JUST (Date 10 3 2026)), `the date on which the question is asked` IS (Date 29 3 2026), `the request stated clearly what the effect of a failure to respond would be` IS TRUE, `the date on which a previous request was sent for the purposes of this paragraph in respect of the same or a similar class of documents or information` IS NOTHING) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a response received on 28 March 2026, the last day of the period
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 10 the person is taken to have agreed that the company may send or supply documents or information to him by means of a website` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a member of the company` IS TRUE, `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a person nominated by a member in accordance with the company's articles to enjoy or exercise all or any specified rights of the member in relation to the company` IS FALSE, `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a person nominated by a member under section 146 to enjoy information rights` IS FALSE, `the members of the company have resolved that the company may send or supply documents or information to members by making them available on a website` IS TRUE, `the company's articles contain provision that the company may send or supply documents or information to members by making them available on a website` IS FALSE, `the company asked the person individually to agree that it may send or supply documents or information generally, or the documents or information in question, to him by means of a website` IS TRUE, `the date on which the company's request was sent` IS (Date 1 3 2026), `the date on which the company received a response` IS (JUST (Date 28 3 2026)), `the date on which the question is asked` IS (Date 29 3 2026), `the request stated clearly what the effect of a failure to respond would be` IS TRUE, `the date on which a previous request was sent for the purposes of this paragraph in respect of the same or a similar class of documents or information` IS NOTHING) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a response received on 1 March 2026, the first day of the period
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 10 the person is taken to have agreed that the company may send or supply documents or information to him by means of a website` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a member of the company` IS TRUE, `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a person nominated by a member in accordance with the company's articles to enjoy or exercise all or any specified rights of the member in relation to the company` IS FALSE, `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a person nominated by a member under section 146 to enjoy information rights` IS FALSE, `the members of the company have resolved that the company may send or supply documents or information to members by making them available on a website` IS TRUE, `the company's articles contain provision that the company may send or supply documents or information to members by making them available on a website` IS FALSE, `the company asked the person individually to agree that it may send or supply documents or information generally, or the documents or information in question, to him by means of a website` IS TRUE, `the date on which the company's request was sent` IS (Date 1 3 2026), `the date on which the company received a response` IS (JUST (Date 1 3 2026)), `the date on which the question is asked` IS (Date 29 3 2026), `the request stated clearly what the effect of a failure to respond would be` IS TRUE, `the date on which a previous request was sent for the purposes of this paragraph in respect of the same or a similar class of documents or information` IS NOTHING) EQUALS JUST FALSE
