#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 10 the person is taken to have agreed that the company may send or supply documents or information to him by means of a website` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a member of the company` IS TRUE, `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a person nominated by a member in accordance with the company's articles to enjoy or exercise all or any specified rights of the member in relation to the company` IS FALSE, `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to the person as a person nominated by a member under section 146 to enjoy information rights` IS FALSE, `the members of the company have resolved that the company may send or supply documents or information to members by making them available on a website` IS TRUE, `the company's articles contain provision that the company may send or supply documents or information to members by making them available on a website` IS FALSE, `the company asked the person individually to agree that it may send or supply documents or information generally, or the documents or information in question, to him by means of a website` IS TRUE, `the date on which the company's request was sent` IS (Date 1 3 2026), `the date on which the company received a response` IS (JUST (Date 29 3 2026)), `the date on which the question is asked` IS (Date 30 3 2026), `the request stated clearly what the effect of a failure to respond would be` IS TRUE, `the date on which a previous request was sent for the purposes of this paragraph in respect of the same or a similar class of documents or information` IS NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
