-- (c) missing: a bare 'must' not done (fork)
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 13(1) the company has notified the intended recipient as the paragraph requires` WITH `the company notified the intended recipient of the presence of the document or information on the website` IS TRUE, `the company notified the intended recipient of the address of the website` IS TRUE, `the company notified the intended recipient of the place on the website where it may be accessed` IS FALSE, `the company notified the intended recipient of how to access the document or information` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (d) missing: a bare 'must' not done (fork)
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 13(1) the company has notified the intended recipient as the paragraph requires` WITH `the company notified the intended recipient of the presence of the document or information on the website` IS TRUE, `the company notified the intended recipient of the address of the website` IS TRUE, `the company notified the intended recipient of the place on the website where it may be accessed` IS TRUE, `the company notified the intended recipient of how to access the document or information` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Para 13(2): taken to be sent on the date the notification is sent or, if later, the date it first appears on the website after that notification.
-- it first appears on 5 March, after the notification of 1 March: 5 March
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 13(2) the date on which the document or information is taken to be sent` (Date 1 3 2026) (JUST (Date 5 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 5 3 2026)
-- it first appears on the day of the notification: 1 March
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 13(2) the date on which the document or information is taken to be sent` (Date 1 3 2026) (JUST (Date 1 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 1 3 2026)
-- it appeared earlier than the notification: the notification date is the later one
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 13(2) the date on which the document or information is taken to be sent` (Date 1 3 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 1 3 2026)
-- it has not yet appeared after the notification: not decided
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 13(2) the date on which the document or information is taken to be sent` (Date 1 3 2026) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- Para 14(1): throughout (a) the period specified by an applicable provision of the Companies Acts or (b) if none, the 28 days beginning with the date the notification is sent.
-- no specified period: the period begins with the notification date, 1 March 2026
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14(1) the period throughout which the document or information must be available` WITH `an applicable provision of the Companies Acts specifies a period` IS FALSE, `the first day of the period so specified` IS (Date 1 1 2026), `the last day of the period so specified` IS (Date 31 1 2026), `the date on which the notification required under paragraph 13 is sent to the person` IS (Date 1 3 2026))'s `sch 5 first day of the period` EQUALS (Date 1 3 2026)
-- no specified period: 28 days beginning with 1 March end on 28 March 2026
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14(1) the period throughout which the document or information must be available` WITH `an applicable provision of the Companies Acts specifies a period` IS FALSE, `the first day of the period so specified` IS (Date 1 1 2026), `the last day of the period so specified` IS (Date 31 1 2026), `the date on which the notification required under paragraph 13 is sent to the person` IS (Date 1 3 2026))'s `sch 5 last day of the period` EQUALS (Date 28 3 2026)
-- a specified period: its first day, 1 January 2026
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14(1) the period throughout which the document or information must be available` WITH `an applicable provision of the Companies Acts specifies a period` IS TRUE, `the first day of the period so specified` IS (Date 1 1 2026), `the last day of the period so specified` IS (Date 31 1 2026), `the date on which the notification required under paragraph 13 is sent to the person` IS (Date 1 3 2026))'s `sch 5 first day of the period` EQUALS (Date 1 1 2026)
-- a specified period: its last day, 31 January 2026
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14(1) the period throughout which the document or information must be available` WITH `an applicable provision of the Companies Acts specifies a period` IS TRUE, `the first day of the period so specified` IS (Date 1 1 2026), `the last day of the period so specified` IS (Date 31 1 2026), `the date on which the notification required under paragraph 13 is sent to the person` IS (Date 1 3 2026))'s `sch 5 last day of the period` EQUALS (Date 31 1 2026)
-- Para 14(1): available throughout the period 1 to 28 March 2026.
-- available 1 to 28 March without a break
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14(1) the document or information was available on the website throughout the period` WITH `the first day of the period` IS (Date 1 3 2026), `the last day of the period` IS (Date 28 3 2026), `the first day on which it was available on the website` IS (Date 1 3 2026), `the last day on which it was available on the website` IS (Date 28 3 2026), `it was available on every day from the first to the last` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- available 28 February to 30 March without a break
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14(1) the document or information was available on the website throughout the period` WITH `the first day of the period` IS (Date 1 3 2026), `the last day of the period` IS (Date 28 3 2026), `the first day on which it was available on the website` IS (Date 28 2 2026), `the last day on which it was available on the website` IS (Date 30 3 2026), `it was available on every day from the first to the last` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- first available on 2 March: one day short at the start
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14(1) the document or information was available on the website throughout the period` WITH `the first day of the period` IS (Date 1 3 2026), `the last day of the period` IS (Date 28 3 2026), `the first day on which it was available on the website` IS (Date 2 3 2026), `the last day on which it was available on the website` IS (Date 28 3 2026), `it was available on every day from the first to the last` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- last available on 27 March: one day short at the end
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14(1) the document or information was available on the website throughout the period` WITH `the first day of the period` IS (Date 1 3 2026), `the last day of the period` IS (Date 28 3 2026), `the first day on which it was available on the website` IS (Date 1 3 2026), `the last day on which it was available on the website` IS (Date 27 3 2026), `it was available on every day from the first to the last` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- available 1 to 28 March but not on every day
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14(1) the document or information was available on the website throughout the period` WITH `the first day of the period` IS (Date 1 3 2026), `the last day of the period` IS (Date 28 3 2026), `the first day on which it was available on the website` IS (Date 1 3 2026), `the last day on which it was available on the website` IS (Date 28 3 2026), `it was available on every day from the first to the last` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Para 14(2): a failure is disregarded if (a) it was available for part of the period and (b) the failure is wholly attributable to circumstances it would not be reasonable to expect the company to prevent or avoid.
-- both limbs
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14(2) the failure to make the document or information available throughout the period is disregarded` WITH `it was made available on the website for part of the period` IS TRUE, `the failure to make it available throughout the period is wholly attributable to circumstances that it would not be reasonable to have expected the company to prevent or avoid` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- available for part, but the failure is not wholly attributable to such circumstances
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14(2) the failure to make the document or information available throughout the period is disregarded` WITH `it was made available on the website for part of the period` IS TRUE, `the failure to make it available throughout the period is wholly attributable to circumstances that it would not be reasonable to have expected the company to prevent or avoid` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- wholly attributable to such circumstances, but never available during the period
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14(2) the failure to make the document or information available throughout the period is disregarded` WITH `it was made available on the website for part of the period` IS FALSE, `the failure to make it available throughout the period is wholly attributable to circumstances that it would not be reasonable to have expected the company to prevent or avoid` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- neither limb
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14(2) the failure to make the document or information available throughout the period is disregarded` WITH `it was made available on the website for part of the period` IS FALSE, `the failure to make it available throughout the period is wholly attributable to circumstances that it would not be reasonable to have expected the company to prevent or avoid` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Para 14 as a whole: throughout the period, or the failure disregarded.
-- available throughout
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14 the company has complied with the duty to keep the document or information available` WITH `the result of sch 5 para 14(1) the document or information was available on the website throughout the period` IS JUST TRUE, `the result of sch 5 para 14(2) the failure to make the document or information available throughout the period is disregarded` IS JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not throughout but the failure is disregarded
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14 the company has complied with the duty to keep the document or information available` WITH `the result of sch 5 para 14(1) the document or information was available on the website throughout the period` IS JUST FALSE, `the result of sch 5 para 14(2) the failure to make the document or information available throughout the period is disregarded` IS JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not throughout and not disregarded (a bare 'must' not done: fork)
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14 the company has complied with the duty to keep the document or information available` WITH `the result of sch 5 para 14(1) the document or information was available on the website throughout the period` IS JUST FALSE, `the result of sch 5 para 14(2) the failure to make the document or information available throughout the period is disregarded` IS JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (1) not decided and (2) does not disregard
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14 the company has complied with the duty to keep the document or information available` WITH `the result of sch 5 para 14(1) the document or information was available on the website throughout the period` IS NOTHING, `the result of sch 5 para 14(2) the failure to make the document or information available throughout the period is disregarded` IS JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (1) fails and (2) not decided
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14 the company has complied with the duty to keep the document or information available` WITH `the result of sch 5 para 14(1) the document or information was available on the website throughout the period` IS JUST FALSE, `the result of sch 5 para 14(2) the failure to make the document or information available throughout the period is disregarded` IS NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (1) not decided but (2) disregards
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 14 the company has complied with the duty to keep the document or information available` WITH `the result of sch 5 para 14(1) the document or information was available on the website throughout the period` IS NOTHING, `the result of sch 5 para 14(2) the failure to make the document or information available throughout the period is disregarded` IS JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Para 8: validly sent by website if made available in accordance with this Part (paras 9, 12(1), 13(1) and 14).
-- all four paragraphs met
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 8 the document or information is validly sent or supplied by being made available on a website` WITH `the result of sch 5 para 9 the document or information may be sent or supplied by the company to the person by being made available on a website` IS JUST TRUE, `the result of sch 5 para 12(1) the document or information has been made available in a form and by a means the paragraph allows` IS JUST TRUE, `the result of sch 5 para 13(1) the company has notified the intended recipient as the paragraph requires` IS JUST TRUE, `the result of sch 5 para 14 the company has complied with the duty to keep the document or information available` IS JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
