#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 8 the document or information is validly sent or supplied by being made available on a website` WITH `the result of sch 5 para 9 the document or information may be sent or supplied by the company to the person by being made available on a website` IS JUST TRUE, `the result of sch 5 para 12(1) the document or information has been made available in a form and by a means the paragraph allows` IS JUST FALSE, `the result of sch 5 para 13(1) the company has notified the intended recipient as the paragraph requires` IS JUST TRUE, `the result of sch 5 para 14 the company has complied with the duty to keep the document or information available` IS JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- para 13(1) not met (an unmet 'if': marginal reading (a))
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 8 the document or information is validly sent or supplied by being made available on a website` WITH `the result of sch 5 para 9 the document or information may be sent or supplied by the company to the person by being made available on a website` IS JUST TRUE, `the result of sch 5 para 12(1) the document or information has been made available in a form and by a means the paragraph allows` IS JUST TRUE, `the result of sch 5 para 13(1) the company has notified the intended recipient as the paragraph requires` IS JUST FALSE, `the result of sch 5 para 14 the company has complied with the duty to keep the document or information available` IS JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- para 14 not met (an unmet 'if': marginal reading (a))
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 8 the document or information is validly sent or supplied by being made available on a website` WITH `the result of sch 5 para 9 the document or information may be sent or supplied by the company to the person by being made available on a website` IS JUST TRUE, `the result of sch 5 para 12(1) the document or information has been made available in a form and by a means the paragraph allows` IS JUST TRUE, `the result of sch 5 para 13(1) the company has notified the intended recipient as the paragraph requires` IS JUST TRUE, `the result of sch 5 para 14 the company has complied with the duty to keep the document or information available` IS JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
