§§ `Part 4 -- the company's duties as regulative rules (read by eye with #TRACE)`

-- Paras 12(1), 13(1) and 14(1) say the company MUST; the text gives no time. A DEONTIC cannot be compared in #ASSERT, so each rule is run with #TRACE.
-- Expected from the text: the company does the act: FULFILLED; the company does nothing: the duty stays standing (no deadline, so no breach).
-- the company does the act: expected FULFILLED
#TRACE `sch 5 para 12(1) the company must make the document or information available so that the recipient can read it and retain a copy` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `sch 5 make the document or information available in a form and by a means that enable the recipient to read it and retain a copy` AT 3

-- the company does nothing: expected the standing duty (no deadline in the text)
#TRACE `sch 5 para 12(1) the company must make the document or information available so that the recipient can read it and retain a copy` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 100)

-- the company does the act: expected FULFILLED
#TRACE `sch 5 para 13(1) the company must notify the intended recipient of the document or information on the website` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `sch 5 notify the intended recipient` AT 3

-- the company does nothing: expected the standing duty (no deadline in the text)
#TRACE `sch 5 para 13(1) the company must notify the intended recipient of the document or information on the website` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 100)

-- the company does the act: expected FULFILLED
#TRACE `sch 5 para 14(1) the company must keep the document or information available on the website throughout the period` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `sch 5 keep the document or information available on the website throughout the period` AT 3

-- the company does nothing: expected the standing duty (no deadline in the text)
#TRACE `sch 5 para 14(1) the company must keep the document or information available on the website throughout the period` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 100)


§§ `Part 5 -- para 15: other agreed forms`

-- neither hard copy, electronic nor website; the intended recipient agreed
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 15 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in another agreed form or manner` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 5 none of those forms`, `the form or manner has been agreed by the intended recipient` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- neither of those; not agreed (an unmet 'if': marginal reading (a))
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 15 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in another agreed form or manner` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 5 none of those forms`, `the form or manner has been agreed by the intended recipient` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- hard copy: para 15 is for 'otherwise than in hard copy or electronic form or by means of a website'
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 15 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in another agreed form or manner` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 5 hard copy form`, `the form or manner has been agreed by the intended recipient` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- electronic: not para 15
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 15 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in another agreed form or manner` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 5 electronic form`, `the form or manner has been agreed by the intended recipient` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- website: not para 15
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 15 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in another agreed form or manner` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 5 made available on a website`, `the form or manner has been agreed by the intended recipient` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Part 6 -- paras 16 and 17: joint holders; death or bankruptcy`

-- Para 16(2): anything to be agreed or specified by the holder must be agreed or specified by all the joint holders.
-- two joint holders, both agreed
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 16(2) the matter is agreed or specified by the joint holders as the paragraph requires` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to joint holders of shares or debentures of a company` IS TRUE, `the number of joint holders` IS 2, `the number of joint holders who agreed or specified the matter` IS 2, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- two joint holders, one agreed
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 16(2) the matter is agreed or specified by the joint holders as the paragraph requires` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to joint holders of shares or debentures of a company` IS TRUE, `the number of joint holders` IS 2, `the number of joint holders who agreed or specified the matter` IS 1, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- one holder (not really joint), agreed
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 16(2) the matter is agreed or specified by the joint holders as the paragraph requires` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to joint holders of shares or debentures of a company` IS TRUE, `the number of joint holders` IS 1, `the number of joint holders who agreed or specified the matter` IS 1, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not joint holders
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 16(2) the matter is agreed or specified by the joint holders as the paragraph requires` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to joint holders of shares or debentures of a company` IS FALSE, `the number of joint holders` IS 2, `the number of joint holders who agreed or specified the matter` IS 2, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the articles provide to a different effect: subject to the articles
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 16(2) the matter is agreed or specified by the joint holders as the paragraph requires` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to joint holders of shares or debentures of a company` IS TRUE, `the number of joint holders` IS 2, `the number of joint holders who agreed or specified the matter` IS 2, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Para 16(3): may be sent (a) to each of the joint holders or (b) to the holder whose name appears first in the register.
-- (a) to each
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 16(3) the document or information may be sent or supplied to the joint holder` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to joint holders of shares or debentures of a company` IS TRUE, `it is sent or supplied to each of the joint holders` IS TRUE, `it is sent or supplied to the holder whose name appears first in the register of members or the relevant register of debenture holders` IS FALSE, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) to the first-named holder
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 16(3) the document or information may be sent or supplied to the joint holder` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to joint holders of shares or debentures of a company` IS TRUE, `it is sent or supplied to each of the joint holders` IS FALSE, `it is sent or supplied to the holder whose name appears first in the register of members or the relevant register of debenture holders` IS TRUE, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- to some other joint holder only: the grant names (a) and (b)
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 16(3) the document or information may be sent or supplied to the joint holder` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to joint holders of shares or debentures of a company` IS TRUE, `it is sent or supplied to each of the joint holders` IS FALSE, `it is sent or supplied to the holder whose name appears first in the register of members or the relevant register of debenture holders` IS FALSE, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- not joint holders
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 16(3) the document or information may be sent or supplied to the joint holder` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to joint holders of shares or debentures of a company` IS FALSE, `it is sent or supplied to each of the joint holders` IS TRUE, `it is sent or supplied to the holder whose name appears first in the register of members or the relevant register of debenture holders` IS FALSE, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the articles provide to a different effect
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 16(3) the document or information may be sent or supplied to the joint holder` WITH `the document or information is to be sent or supplied to joint holders of shares or debentures of a company` IS TRUE, `it is sent or supplied to each of the joint holders` IS TRUE, `it is sent or supplied to the holder whose name appears first in the register of members or the relevant register of debenture holders` IS FALSE, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Para 17(5): references to bankruptcy include sequestration and a protected trust deed.
-- bankruptcy
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 17(5) the event is bankruptcy for the purposes of the paragraph` `sch 5 para 17(5) bankruptcy in the ordinary sense` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sequestration (para 17(5)(a))
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 17(5) the event is bankruptcy for the purposes of the paragraph` `sch 5 para 17(5) sequestration of the estate of a person` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- protected trust deed (para 17(5)(b))
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 17(5) the event is bankruptcy for the purposes of the paragraph` `sch 5 para 17(5) a person's estate being the subject of a protected trust deed` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 'include' does not close the list
#ASSERT `sch 5 para 17(5) the event is bankruptcy for the purposes of the paragraph` `sch 5 para 17(5) some other insolvency event` EQUALS NOTHING
-- Para 17(2): on the death or bankruptcy of a holder of shares, to the persons claiming to be entitled by name or title, at the UK address they supplied.
-- died or bankrupt; by name or title; at the address they supplied
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 17(2) the document or information may be sent or supplied to the persons claiming to be entitled` WITH `the holder of the company's shares has died or become bankrupt` IS TRUE, `the document or information is sent to the persons claiming to be entitled to the shares in consequence of the death or bankruptcy by name or by the title of representatives of the deceased, or trustee of the bankrupt, or by any like description` IS TRUE, `it is sent at the address in the United Kingdom supplied for the purpose by those so claiming` IS TRUE, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- by name or title but not at an address they supplied
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 17(2) the document or information may be sent or supplied to the persons claiming to be entitled` WITH `the holder of the company's shares has died or become bankrupt` IS TRUE, `the document or information is sent to the persons claiming to be entitled to the shares in consequence of the death or bankruptcy by name or by the title of representatives of the deceased, or trustee of the bankrupt, or by any like description` IS TRUE, `it is sent at the address in the United Kingdom supplied for the purpose by those so claiming` IS FALSE, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the holder neither died nor became bankrupt
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 17(2) the document or information may be sent or supplied to the persons claiming to be entitled` WITH `the holder of the company's shares has died or become bankrupt` IS FALSE, `the document or information is sent to the persons claiming to be entitled to the shares in consequence of the death or bankruptcy by name or by the title of representatives of the deceased, or trustee of the bankrupt, or by any like description` IS TRUE, `it is sent at the address in the United Kingdom supplied for the purpose by those so claiming` IS TRUE, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the articles provide to a different effect
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 17(2) the document or information may be sent or supplied to the persons claiming to be entitled` WITH `the holder of the company's shares has died or become bankrupt` IS TRUE, `the document or information is sent to the persons claiming to be entitled to the shares in consequence of the death or bankruptcy by name or by the title of representatives of the deceased, or trustee of the bankrupt, or by any like description` IS TRUE, `it is sent at the address in the United Kingdom supplied for the purpose by those so claiming` IS TRUE, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Para 17(3): until such an address has been supplied, in any manner in which it might have been sent if the death or bankruptcy had not occurred.
-- no address yet supplied; sent as it might have been before
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 17(3) the document or information may be sent or supplied in the manner that applied before the death or bankruptcy` WITH `the holder of the company's shares has died or become bankrupt` IS TRUE, `those claiming to be entitled have supplied an address in the United Kingdom` IS FALSE, `it is sent or supplied in a manner in which it might have been sent or supplied if the death or bankruptcy had not occurred` IS TRUE, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an address has been supplied: the 'until' bar has ended (ruling of 2026-11-05)
#ASSERT (`sch 5 para 17(3) the document or information may be sent or supplied in the manner that applied before the death or bankruptcy` WITH `the holder of the company's shares has died or become bankrupt` IS TRUE, `those claiming to be entitled have supplied an address in the United Kingdom` IS TRUE, `it is sent or supplied in a manner in which it might have been sent or supplied if the death or bankruptcy had not occurred` IS TRUE, `the company's articles contain provision to a different effect` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no address yet supplied; sent in some other manner
